#### **Electric Vehicle (EV) Charging Networks:**  
The expansion of electric vehicle charging infrastructure is essential for encouraging the adoption of EVs as a sustainable transportation option. Cities like San Diego have implemented city-wide charging networks that include fast-charging stations in public parking areas, along major thoroughfares, and at workplaces. These charging stations can be monitored through mobile apps that provide real-time availability updates, helping users locate nearby charging options easily. Furthermore, strategic partnerships with local businesses can incentivize the installation of charging stations, making it convenient for residents and employees to charge their vehicles while they shop or work.

